    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To become the best ninja, you will have to do some training... dangerous training. But training nevertheless. Jump, climb, and sprint your way through levels that are... never the same?\u00a0<br><br>A real ninja has to be prepared for anything. Complete mini levels a certain amount of times to win. Catch is, every time you play a level, it will be different!<br><br><strong>LEVELS ARE NEVER THE SAME?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>That's right! Through seed based generation, you will never get the same level twice. Random obstacles and hazards are placed every time you attempt a level. You only get one chance, so unleash your inner ninja skills or its back to square one!<br><br><strong>STORY MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to different locations to train and become the best! Contains several levels where the structure remains the same, but obstacles and hazards that spawn in are completely random!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RANDOM MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are procedurally\u00a0generated. Never play the same level twice with millions of different possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR NINJA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show the world you are the best ninja with different cosmetics that can only be earned by completing difficult tasks!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To become the best ninja, you will have to do some training... dangerous training. But training nevertheless. Jump, climb, and sprint your way through levels that are... never the same?\u00a0<br><br>A real ninja has to be prepared for anything. Complete mini levels a certain amount of times to win. Catch is, every time you play a level, it will be different!<br><br><strong>LEVELS ARE NEVER THE SAME?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>That's right! Through seed based generation, you will never get the same level twice. Random obstacles and hazards are placed every time you attempt a level. You only get one chance, so unleash your inner ninja skills or its back to square one!<br><br><strong>STORY MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to different locations to train and become the best! Contains several levels where the structure remains the same, but obstacles and hazards that spawn in are completely random!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RANDOM MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are procedurally\u00a0generated. Never play the same level twice with millions of different possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR NINJA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show the world you are the best ninja with different cosmetics that can only be earned by completing difficult tasks!</p>",
